---
layout: layouts/base.vto
title: Home
description: The Idea Keep is a public lab book for ideas, experiments, learnings, projects, and useful artifacts.
url: /
---
<section class="hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">A public lab book</p>
  <h1>Ideas worth keeping.<br><span>Experiments worth attempting.</span></h1>
  <p class="hero-copy">
    The Idea Keep is a home for work in progress: thoughts can begin as seeds,
    experiments can fail in public, and useful learnings can emerge over time.
  </p>
  <p class="principle"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span> Unfinished is publishable.</p>
</section>

<section class="hatchery" aria-labelledby="hatchery-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">The Hatchery</p>
      <h2 id="hatchery-title">From the Hatchery</h2>
    </div>
    <p>Early thoughts, hypotheses, and the beginnings of things.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="content-list">
    {{ for item of search.pages("publicationStatus=published kind=idea", "date=desc title=asc-locale") }}
    <article class="content-card">
      <div class="metadata" aria-label="Content metadata">
        <span class="badge badge-kind">{{ item.kindLabel }}</span>
        <span class="badge">{{ item.maturityLabel }}</span>
        <time datetime="{{ item.displayDate }}">{{ item.displayDate }}</time>
      </div>
      <h3><a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.title }}</a></h3>
      <p>{{ item.summary }}</p>
      <a class="read-link" href="{{ item.url }}" aria-label="Read {{ item.title }}">Enter the chamber <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </article>
    {{ /for }}
  </div>
</section>
